# 6. ABOUT THE CONFERENCE

Section heading:

## About the Conference

Use the following complete content:

The **International Conference on Multidisciplinary Innovations in Technology and Engineering (ICMITE 2026)** aims to provide a premier international platform for researchers, academicians, scientists, industry professionals, and students to exchange knowledge, present innovative research, and foster multidisciplinary collaboration. The conference focuses on recent advancements and emerging innovations in Technology and Engineering, covering diverse areas such as Mechanical Engineering, Electronics and Communication Engineering, Electrical and Electronics Engineering, Computer Science and Engineering, Applied Sciences and Humanities, Biomedical Engineering, Cyber Security, Blockchain, Artificial Intelligence, Data Science, Internet of Things, Smart Systems, Industry 4.0, Renewable Energy, Sustainable Technologies, and Digital Transformation. ICMITE 2026 seeks to promote high-quality research, interdisciplinary innovation, and academia–industry collaboration, encouraging the development of advanced and sustainable technological solutions to address global challenges and contribute to a smarter, sustainable, and technologically advanced future.

